.env.production

# ── .NET / Backend ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bin/
obj/
*.user
.vs/
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Secrets.json

# Throwaway build/test output dirs used by agents to verify without disturbing
